{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EKxyqCE2MCtg2a37Lq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Happy to help with this. Your facts already cover most of what I need. These answers would change what the speech says:\n\n1. **What exactly is the commission voting on tonight?** For example, a rezoning, a conditional use permit, a variance, or a site plan approval. I want to end by asking them to do the specific thing in front of them.\n2. **What are the neighbors who oppose it saying, and will they be speaking?** Traffic, parking, building height, \"neighborhood character,\" something else? You live two blocks away on the road the traffic study covers, so you're the best person in the room to answer the traffic worry. I want to aim at the objection they'll actually hear.\n3. **Does the plan do anything about Alder and 4th?** For example, a new signal, a turn lane, or a bus stop nearby. If nothing is planned, that's fine. I'll handle the C-to-D drop honestly either way.\n4. **Do you have a personal story to tell in a sentence or two?** Maybe someone you know who's on the waiting list or can't afford to live nearby, or what Alder Road is really like at 5 pm after 19 years there.\n5. **Are you speaking only for yourself, or also for the church?** This changes how you introduce yourself and whether you should say you're a member.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so and I'll write around them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":9541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":355},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8df787a7-7aaf-4705-a9fc-e95539601c85","uuid":"84b1657b-93c